@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour - Read and reply: no free form thread
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Member" as actor
box "Frontend - barnabas application and libraries" #E0F2FE
  participant "ThreadComponent" as page
  participant "IThreadService / THREAD_SERVICE" as client
end box
box "Backend - Barnabas.Api HTTP pipeline" #D1FADF
  participant "ThreadsController" as api
end box
box "Backend - Barnabas.Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
  participant "GetThreadQueryHandler / SendMessageCommandHandler" as handler
  participant "MessageThread / Message / ThreadReadMark" as entity
end box
box "Backend - Barnabas.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  database "SQL Server / scoped persistence" as db
end box
actor -> page : View another member profile [L2-069]
page --> actor : Profile and listings; no direct-message action
client -> api : Attempt POST /threads with arbitrary member identifier
api --> client : 404; no matching create-thread endpoint [L2-069]
note over handler, db : No handler executes and no thread is inserted
@enduml
